 ective good energy into tangible support during these incredibly difficult
  times. What to Expect Live Music by: No Nation Mango Matic DJ Juan Carlex
 x DJ Victor Lopes Incredible artists bringing the healing power of sound. 
 Great Food and Drinks: Grab a plate\, connect with the community\, and fue
 l up for a good cause. Tattoo Raffle: Try your luck to win a fresh piece o
 f ink from Voltio Tattoo (worth $1200)*. Good Energy: A community coming t
 ogether in solidarity to make a real difference. All proceeds go directly 
 to Venezuelan earthquake relief efforts. Come through\, give back\, and sh
 are the love! Let's turn our good energy into tangible support. Date: 18th
  September\, from 6pm Location: Miami Marketta
