SUMMARY:lowbrain (Perth)
DESCRIPTION:Boorloo / Perth-based producer Lowbrain is the West Coast of Au
 s’s biggest up and comer in dance music and is already making his mark o
 n the local and international dance scenes. Debuting in 2024 on Perth labe
 l Lab Six Records\, Lowbrain is now working closely with the team at Love 
 Clvb / Sweat It Out and working on some sneaky bits with Luude’s No Inst
 ruction label. Lowbrain has received strong support from the local music s
 cene in Perth\, having headlined shows at the Vault and for Tina Says’ B
 ody Control as well as having supported the likes of Bella Claxton\, LO’
 99\, Tina Says and Solsta. Lowbrain effortlessly blends hip-hop-influenced
  heaters with bumpy classic flows\, or four on the floor bangers with two-
 step slammers\, displaying huge versatility and always leaving you wonderi
 ng what he’s going to do next. Despite hailing from the most isolated ca
 pital city in the world\, Lowbrain’s reach is undeniable with his tracks
  already making waves on the global club circuit with support on his ID ca
 talogue including Interplanetary Criminal\, Club Angel\, Bushbaby\, Benwal
 \, Badger\, Its Murph\, Morgan Seatree\, and many more. Lowbrain has also 
 received consistent industry recognition amounting several BBC Radio 1 spi
 ns\, A George FM Drive spotlight and Mahi Mix takeover\, multiple simultan
 eous Spotify + Apple Music editorial placements and plenty of chatter on v
 arious Triple J specialty programs. Kicking off 2026 and with a focus on h
 is unreleased club-heavers\, Lowbrain is touching down with a USB full of 
 IDs and live set exclusives\, featuring a ton of collabs with both local a
 nd international heavyweights. #block-5df3c5a122ab703bfd16 { --stroke-styl
