UID:goldcoast-q0w5rq@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260920T003000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260920T023000
SUMMARY:A SALUTE TO ROY ORBISON
DESCRIPTION:Direct from Las Vegas\, YOU GOT IT! A SALUTE TO ROY ORBISON is 
 an unforgettable concert experience\, starring multi-award-winning artist 
 John Stephan. Superstar Roy Orbison was one of the world’s greatest and 
 most successful rock’n’roll music legends of all time. Wesley Orbison\
 , Roy Orbison’s eldest son\, is proud to fully endorse and present this 
 show honouring and remembering his father. It features narration from Wesl
 ey\, who delivers a very personal narrative of Roy’s intriguing yet trag
 ic life. Internationally renowned artist John Stephan has a voice filled w
 ith warmth\, emotion and a four-octave range. Known as ‘The Voice’\, J
 ohn will take audience on an incredible trip through the storied career of
  Orbison\, covering a multitude of his chart-topping hits. Relive the glor
 y days as John Stephan performs iconic songs such as Pretty Woman\, Crying
 \, I Drove All Night\, Leah\, Working for the Man\, Blue Bayou\, Only the 
 Lonely\, In Dreams\, Blue Angel\, You Got It\, Running Scared and many mor
 e. This is a concert experience not to be missed!
LOCATION:The Showroom\, 2 Wharf st\, Tweed Heads\, NSW 2486
URL:https://twintowns.com.au/events/a-salute-to-roy-orbison/
END:VEVENT
