 riller and once again melt some fine cheddar in the name of high-value ent
 ertainment. The mission statement is simple\; play upbeat ‘cheezy’ hit
  songs that many will know\, with a positive vibe\, great musicianship\, h
 igh quality production\, get everyone in the audience dancing\, singing\, 
 laughing\, and generally having a grand old time. The Supercheeze fondue-p
 ot consists of Roy Wilders on lead vocals (when he’s not touring his nat
 ive Ireland in search of the elusive mozzarell potato) Mick Dunham on guit
 ar and co-lead vocals\, Dean Jones on guitar and co-lead vocals\, Greg Str
 ong on bass guitar and co-lead vocals. And sitting behind the kit with occ
 asional lead vocals Mark Bridges\, who once claimed the title of downhill 
 cheese-rolling champion of Clunes three years consecutively……..amazing
 ! So just remember……when life gets you down\, don’t just whine\, get
  some ‘Cheeze’ into you\, and dance the night away!
LOCATION:The Stage (18+)\, 2 Wharf st\, Tweed Heads\, NSW 2486
URL:https://twintowns.com.au/events/supercheeze-2/
